DexSwapModule::constructor
├── when router is zero address
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModule_ZeroRouter
├── when router has no code (EOA)
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModule_RouterNotContract
└── when router is a valid contract
    ├── it should set the immutable router address
    └── it should return "SWAP" from moduleType()
